    <node id="Soggetti Essenziali">
      <data key="d0">Soggetti Essenziali</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">I Soggetti Essenziali si riferiscono a entità identificate come cruciali per il funzionamento della società, soggetti a regole specifiche.&lt;SEP&gt;I soggetti essenziali sono entità identificate che devono rispettare obblighi specifici e sono soggetti a sanzioni per violazioni.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti Essenziali are entities identified as critical for the functioning of society and the economy, whose registration is mandated for cybersecurity purposes under current regulations. These essential entities are crucial because any compromise could result in significant impacts on public services and national security. As such, they are obligated to implement risk management measures related to cybersecurity to protect their information systems and networks.

Under established regulatory frameworks, particularly in relation to cybersecurity, Soggetti Essenziali are required to adhere to specific security obligations and product and service standards as outlined by legal provisions. This compliance is essential for maintaining national security standards, given the sensitive information these entities manage. Furthermore, they must communicate updates regarding their activities and services based on defined criteria and report any significant cybersecurity incidents to CSIRT Italia.

The classification of Soggetti Essenziali transcends the typical thresholds for medium-sized enterprises, encompassing a variety of critical entities regardless of size, as specified by the Direttiva NIS. This comprehensive oversight underscores their vital role in ensuring the stability and security of essential public services and infrastructure, thereby highlighting their importance in safeguarding public safety and health.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti Essenziali refers to essential subjects or organizations that are critical to specific regulatory frameworks and their compliance is monitored.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59c62341e6dbdcf3426bec3e9017f906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd23bee19c00c0afe07a6df8f6d9bb94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55db37557223ceb33c56d82e5f0207bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f4f98b1c2d2070c1c1800937a75e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19de381a5517d614701de183ccc97f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8b7f52f808d1b9c8258f9c2df76552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca2f8d685c1e46812789bb56f1f5f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9f5969404a18bd68f16df966d64a713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf8de775b62187a961a092f019a565ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31185bea266047e27967ebc4d42a28e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484df9d473d54e589fa3c8ffe837ea7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6125ee49e9153fb4b54bb70ae56be103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70958e41947f1856a02ce9f16c9fc2d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86656548de9bfd0478a2d1b0fe96d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4efb79385162ec030f628dd53195cda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ff7d744f17e74ad5f97cec6205c467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bca68d15e92b884efd92720e2c7854b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dff57220606107f074f3f461176a191e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edcb0cfb3d603a54ef204d72849d9e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594f5a01726ea26a8c05db0a073a3762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc2d05ad9613f280438ab5c7cc47980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5919b394f61097b3c448dfb4508004c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d776982364dc89bd130a2d3605148e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe</data>
