    </node>
    <node id="Soggetti Importanti">
      <data key="d0">Soggetti Importanti</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">I Soggetti Importanti sono entità indicate come rilevanti nel contesto di regolamenti specifici, con sanzioni amministrative ridotte.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti Importanti refers to important subjects or organizations that play a significant role under regulatory oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti Importanti refers to significant entities that require registration for cybersecurity, although they are classified as having an operational value lower than that of essential subjects. These entities provide services that contribute to the security and stability of vital sectors, and while their interruption may have a lesser impact compared to essential subjects, it remains significant enough to warrant regulatory oversight.

Soggetti Importanti are obligated to comply with regulations similar to those imposed on essential subjects, particularly concerning risk management and security measures. They play a crucial role in the implementation of security protocols and are required to communicate and update information about their activities and services. Furthermore, they must report significant incidents to CSIRT Italia, demonstrating their active participation in cybersecurity efforts.

In accordance with the NIS Directive, Soggetti Importanti must adhere to specific cybersecurity regulations as part of their operational responsibilities. They also have the option, though it is not strictly mandated, to voluntarily report cybersecurity incidents affecting their services. Overall, these entities are essential for maintaining a robust cybersecurity landscape and ensuring compliance with applicable standards and regulatory obligations, despite not being classified as essential.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59c62341e6dbdcf3426bec3e9017f906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd23bee19c00c0afe07a6df8f6d9bb94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f4f98b1c2d2070c1c1800937a75e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8b7f52f808d1b9c8258f9c2df76552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6125ee49e9153fb4b54bb70ae56be103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70958e41947f1856a02ce9f16c9fc2d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31185bea266047e27967ebc4d42a28e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484df9d473d54e589fa3c8ffe837ea7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86656548de9bfd0478a2d1b0fe96d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4efb79385162ec030f628dd53195cda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ff7d744f17e74ad5f97cec6205c467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bca68d15e92b884efd92720e2c7854b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dff57220606107f074f3f461176a191e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edcb0cfb3d603a54ef204d72849d9e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594f5a01726ea26a8c05db0a073a3762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc2d05ad9613f280438ab5c7cc47980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d776982364dc89bd130a2d3605148e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe</data>
