    <node id="Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale">
      <data key="d0">Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale is an authoritative agency tasked with ensuring cybersecurity and establishing measures for sanctioning violations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale is responsible for national cybersecurity in Italy and receives budget allocations from administrative sanctions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale is the agency dedicated to cybersecurity in Italy, receiving funds from administrative penalties.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale is the national authority responsible for cybersecurity in Italy. It operates as the competent authority under the NIS (Network and Information Security) directive and is an integral part of the Italian CSIRT (Computer Security Incident Response Team). The agency plays a pivotal role in coordinating cybersecurity efforts and policies, and it works closely with the Presidency of the Council of Ministers to enhance national cybersecurity.

The Agenzia intervenes in significant cybersecurity incidents, ensuring a structured response and management. Its responsibilities encompass implementing technical measures to promote a coordinated vulnerability disclosure policy across the country. Moreover, it establishes mandates and methods to ensure compliance and monitor relevant subjects in line with the NIS decree.

In addition to focusing on national cyber resilience, the agency is dedicated to protecting critical infrastructures and maintaining the overall information security of the state. It is also involved in the review of cybersecurity practices and designating experts for inspections, reflecting its comprehensive role in safeguarding Italy’s cybersecurity landscape. The agency is tasked with implementing the National Cybersecurity Strategy and coordinating national cybersecurity efforts, underlining its central function in fortifying the nation's information security systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8dd112d6d7123fa65b6dbdc301dfb1d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c62341e6dbdcf3426bec3e9017f906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f4f98b1c2d2070c1c1800937a75e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0038be33f7feedcdeb87d1ba67ddaabe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd252fa1c05426d3e43270f7b9103fd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5e6f420f6cc4d279f4af29bbcf840e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-923745bc8c8ad932bf6f4d0e052b32a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9f5969404a18bd68f16df966d64a713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-823e4bcb44a0430e6bbba96d50184704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841174697e4d1adb00807b4c235dad95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ef18d1a3b91f1ea18ed5bb73781676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64ef5b105da295a0d80cfd3580be9c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0e4ec39b25d6db8b5b1e0c721b2754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe59d78b7f30a5635c0de425f655d571&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ea6561085c9fb8326503d1574198c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5919b394f61097b3c448dfb4508004c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa8a0533ff9128b6afab4fc093e281b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0e3349b8cc8de1fb400ca0da504fff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe</data>
