    <node id="Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale">
      <data key="d0">Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale is the national agency responsible for cybersecurity coordination and incident management in Italy, designated as the single point of contact under NIS directives.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale, known in English as the Agency for National Cybersecurity, is a governmental agency in Italy responsible for national cybersecurity policies and their implementation. It holds the mandate to assess and periodically update the national cybersecurity strategy in Italy, ensuring that the country is equipped to handle evolving cybersecurity challenges.

As the national authority for cybersecurity, the agency coordinates Italy's cybersecurity efforts and serves as a key point of contact for issues related to the European Union's NIS Directive. This role includes facilitating cooperation between national authorities and other EU member states, thereby enhancing collective cybersecurity resilience across Europe.

The Agenzia is tasked with enforcing compliance among service providers and overseeing the implementation of national cybersecurity policies and measures. Its responsibilities extend to managing significant cyber incidents and coordinating crisis management efforts in line with EU directives. It plays a critical role in safeguarding Italy's cybersecurity infrastructure by overseeing information security activities as mandated by various laws and decrees.

Furthermore, the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale functions as the national Computer Security Incident Response Team (CSIRT), emphasizing its essential role in cybersecurity coordination. It implements technical solutions to support a coordinated vulnerability disclosure policy and provides guidance on technical specifications to address cybersecurity threats effectively.

In summary, the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale is integral to establishing and maintaining cybersecurity standards in Italy. It manages national cybersecurity initiatives and facilitates the sharing of information regarding cybersecurity threats, ensuring the security and resilience of Italy's cyber ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Cybersecurity Agency is responsible for coordinating security efforts and responses to cybersecurity incidents in Italy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e247eadbfc4b83e0f2e2cc2151578109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd470b0d0545e260b3ec4b4200485ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b824e0b89de2a1e27b0589d38a4cd97d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21684571833f4b28671ad0cd40b78ac8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4afbcc356a5cad070006284b04c6eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004703168628c6aaccaf0aac8aed014f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a799f9bf34f632ba75a0112b5cf13046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c92e8c6868003608beac05c39d102b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ac85b75b9a0982916688ed2e7a5268&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b762ae6bc9abced0fc47e1227f90166b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1438f57bb8c01c2bc53a9597dce8694f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e4324dfac9792a4d9eef15127f75b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3116d335c306732798ce61c729fe9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a09a98f23c165c2285989df098e2deae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c500aa2aa69abadcee3c103dd7106f97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eff45611527f82dfc397b30cdd492180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3574f28f12a3390bb92440df5eda9ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d008e433ea6328598c9f502f5b2a9875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23a0918358a7732eec078565600a96b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff824a8d4fd7ac945910f70fbbda425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec85a32073c7d50fe528ce38d609671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e0e75c3b7d45965634f03b7bc21efd</data>
