    <node id="Decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82">
      <data key="d0">Decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decree-Law of June 14, 2021, n. 82 addresses cybersecurity and personal data breaches in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;Decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82 is a governmental decree in Italy that addresses aspects of cybersecurity and its governance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82 is an Italian law concerning digital administration and cybersecurity policies.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a legislative act that establishes the functions and responsibilities of CSIRT Italia regarding cybersecurity incidents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ceda7e1e5e4925ac0d4f0b61bcc3f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb35bd367b636533a9fb6889ae8c322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114b1362fb84968e146ca23e283cba2b</data>
