    <node id="Legge 4 agosto 2021, n. 109">
      <data key="d0">Legge 4 agosto 2021, n. 109</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Legge 4 agosto 2021, n. 109 is a law that modifies previous legislation related to financial and economic penalties.&lt;SEP&gt;Legge 4 agosto 2021, n. 109 is an Italian law that modifies previous regulations in the context of cybersecurity and public administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Questa legge è correlata al decreto-legge sul cyber security e regola la gestione delle crisi informatiche in Italia.&lt;SEP&gt;This law converts and modifies the Decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, outlining the legal framework for CSIRT Italia's operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb35bd367b636533a9fb6889ae8c322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64ef5b105da295a0d80cfd3580be9c4b</data>
