      <data key="d0">Ministeri della giustizia, dell'interno e della difesa</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">These ministries are part of the Italian government, involved in justice, internal affairs, and defense, respectively, and play roles in cybersecurity matters.</data>
