    <node id="Ministero dell'interno">
      <data key="d0">Ministero dell'interno</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ministero dell'interno is the Italian Ministry of the Interior responsible for security and regulation of telecommunication services.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministry of the Interior is a government body responsible for managing internal security and telecommunications regulations in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministry of the Interior manages domestic affairs, including public safety and internal security, in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministero dell'interno is the Italian Ministry of the Interior, overseeing internal security and administrative functions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-114b1362fb84968e146ca23e283cba2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_4.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Ministero della difesa">
      <data key="d0">Ministero della difesa</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ministero della difesa is the Italian Ministry of Defense involved in managing cybersecurity crises.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministero della difesa, or the Ministry of Defense in Italy, serves as the national authority for managing cybersecurity crises and possesses specific competencies in this area. It is an essential government agency with a primary focus on national security, overseeing defense policies, and the organization of the military. In addition to its role in state defense-related matters, the Ministero della difesa collaborates on cybersecurity management and acts as a crisis authority, ensuring a comprehensive approach to national defense and crisis management in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministero della difesa is the Italian Ministry of Defense responsible for national security and defense operations, including cybersecurity incident management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114b1362fb84968e146ca23e283cba2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ceda7e1e5e4925ac0d4f0b61bcc3f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b762ae6bc9abced0fc47e1227f90166b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3574f28f12a3390bb92440df5eda9ca</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_4.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_14.json</data>
    </node>
