    <node id="Commissione europea">
      <data key="d0">Commissione europea</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">La Commissione europea è l'organo dell'Unione Europea che riceve notifiche e strategie dall'Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale e dal Ministero della difesa.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commissione europea is the European Commission, which is involved in regulatory and coordination roles within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission is involved in the exchange of information related to European Union regulations and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commissione europea is the European Commission, responsible for proposing legislation and upholding EU treaties, and may be consulted by the NIS authority.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commissione europea is the executive branch of the European Union, involved in proposing legislation and managing day-to-day affairs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3574f28f12a3390bb92440df5eda9ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eff45611527f82dfc397b30cdd492180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe9d12702503967b563f73226bd6c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53b540306cae3f5d4ac372c47e02440</data>
