    <node id="Attività di informazione per la sicurezza">
      <data key="d0">Attività di informazione per la sicurezza</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Security information activities are those operations designed to safeguard national interests and public safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eff45611527f82dfc397b30cdd492180</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_4.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Commissione Europea">
      <data key="d0">Commissione Europea</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">La Commissione Europea è l'organo esecutivo dell'Unione Europea e coinvolta nel coordinamento delle politiche di sicurezza informatica.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commissione Europea, known in English as the European Commission, is the executive body of the European Union (EU) that plays a crucial role in overseeing the implementation of policies and agreements among member states. It is tasked with proposing legislation, implementing decisions, and ensuring compliance with EU treaties and laws. Additionally, the Commissione Europea is involved in strategic initiatives, including cooperation in areas such as cybersecurity. Overall, it serves as the executive branch of the EU, responsible for the development and enforcement of legislation and policies that affect the member states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70958e41947f1856a02ce9f16c9fc2d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b0bb9bde1347c627566bd2362d82fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19de381a5517d614701de183ccc97f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0e4ec39b25d6db8b5b1e0c721b2754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9490309e2fc520894aac16ef2d39a46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b39a557e445658829217fe6071239fa6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_4.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Unione Europea">
      <data key="d0">Unione Europea</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Unione Europea (European Union, EU) is a significant political and economic union comprising 27 member states primarily located in Europe. This organization aims to foster integration and cooperation among its members across various sectors, with a strong emphasis on issues such as security and cybersecurity. The EU operates under a framework of shared rules and regulations, which govern jurisdiction and services among its member states, thereby ensuring security and economic stability.

The Unione Europea actively engages in legislative activities, implementing various directives like UE 2022/2555 and 2022/2557, which are designed to enhance collaboration in the field of cybersecurity. Its efforts include the coordinated management of large-scale cyber incidents as part of a National Plan, highlighting its commitment to addressing common challenges faced by member states.

Additionally, the EU establishes guidelines and regulations aimed at protecting rights related to information confidentiality and national security, thus playing a crucial role in safeguarding the collective interests of its members. By promoting mutual support and regulatory coherence, the Unione Europea enhances both collective security and the framework necessary for managing cybersecurity risks. The organization also emphasizes cooperation on broader political and economic issues, further solidifying its role as a key player in international relations among European countries.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cc907ff351cc6fbaa119d649c75f845b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70f0567946102de362e38795f66fb304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8fb1e80c6588d63904d0fbfbe52f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ac90d585f71a4788b677c9d4597cb8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19de381a5517d614701de183ccc97f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8b7f52f808d1b9c8258f9c2df76552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79110363e2fdbfe3d29b375599dab210&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4342fc4ff6b1b13ab6a3f36cb4e0098a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f04da85eec001fc88b58f83742dd5c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c35a9cee97ca2d6904cdecfa96ae491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ceda7e1e5e4925ac0d4f0b61bcc3f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b0bb9bde1347c627566bd2362d82fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a27aa8d0bb3182a3820bfb4881cd0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-823e4bcb44a0430e6bbba96d50184704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aeea7f868e572ca2683710a23021720&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffa3df8decb742aba92a8f1157aabf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c4f103bc5263a7ed18ca930ed8b9da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d33217045cb72b052be017e5e11b563b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8377fe9a87e8f911c762411e7d09fbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42459c9f4aed311ed314d3fc91766340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a09a98f23c165c2285989df098e2deae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753a7ed896a229ef5f44ed6c498cbd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62eb392517072085e7cc966fc793312b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-918a3c8c9a0bb2f72084c1d4a4433b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_4.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_20.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_5.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Sicurezza Nazionale">
      <data key="d0">Sicurezza Nazionale</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sicurezza Nazionale pertains to issues regarding a nation's safety and protection from threats.&lt;SEP&gt;Sicurezza Nazionale refers to the measures and policies implemented to protect the nation's safety, security, and sovereignty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8dd112d6d7123fa65b6dbdc301dfb1d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19de381a5517d614701de183ccc97f6f</data>
