    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 40">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 40</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Articolo 40 is a significant legislative article that outlines specific regulations and compliance requirements applicable to certain entities, particularly concerning TIC (Technology, Information, and Communications) products and services. It details the criteria and procedures involved in identifying subjects to whom these regulations apply. Additionally, Articolo 40 establishes provisions for the regulation of activities by sector authorities and maintains certain provisions until further determinations are made. The article is essential for ensuring the effective organization and oversight of essential and important subjects within the legislative framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4efb79385162ec030f628dd53195cda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12f5f78bc26c1c21e65f4781aff2757c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41ca6b4dd93e0c17d473199f99238cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594f5a01726ea26a8c05db0a073a3762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8b7f52f808d1b9c8258f9c2df76552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e5212ab2d4a732b547eae6f0a381bab</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_41.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_34.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 41">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 41</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Articolo 41 is included in the discussion of provisions that continue to apply until they are contradicted by new legal determinations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41ca6b4dd93e0c17d473199f99238cb9</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_41.json</data>
    </node>
