      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Provvedimenti Attuativi refers to the implementing measures related to Articles 40 and 41 of the Decreto Legislativo, which continue to apply until further determinations are made.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41ca6b4dd93e0c17d473199f99238cb9</data>
