    <node id="Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS">
      <data key="d0">Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS is a national authority in Italy responsible for overseeing compliance with specific regulations concerning the security of networks and information systems. Its main duties include enforcing adherence to legal standards, sanctioning violations, and imposing administrative penalties on responsible parties. This public entity is tasked with supervising essential and important service providers to ensure compliance with cybersecurity regulations, particularly in accordance with the EU Directive 2022/2555 concerning network and information systems (NIS).

The authority conducts verification and inspection activities, identifies key subjects, and manages registrations on a digital platform dedicated to cybersecurity. It plays a significant role in coordinating vulnerability disclosure policies and supervising activities associated with social networks within the EU framework. To maintain cybersecurity compliance, the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS performs audits and risk assessments that evaluate the adherence to established security obligations among stakeholders.

Additionally, the authority is active in the NIS Cooperation Group, which facilitates information sharing on cybersecurity issues. It can also take legal action against organizations that violate cybersecurity standards, thereby contributing to the protection of critical infrastructures and ensuring personal data security. Through its comprehensive regulatory oversight, the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS plays a crucial role in enhancing cybersecurity across Italy, facilitating necessary interventions and support as mandated by law to safeguard national information systems and networks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc907ff351cc6fbaa119d649c75f845b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097b04a09e0b581c1371bf708d2c9385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b069a2848ec3f27bf4ee85e079a65b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd23bee19c00c0afe07a6df8f6d9bb94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea541069c915be71a2deaffcb4067d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55db37557223ceb33c56d82e5f0207bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd252fa1c05426d3e43270f7b9103fd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5e6f420f6cc4d279f4af29bbcf840e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c5c752be2baa10ee6d35eaa5f1c98b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6f2ee79d69b2e0e0b40a96b7e26f33e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca2f8d685c1e46812789bb56f1f5f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9e8d96b5144e4e7bea4d0b4800c03b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62ae4e3fef9aedd70aed7cff7804a838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24680fdd6d24ab9a12ee08ca699800d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26bbb300d251c26612092b2e60977328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-923745bc8c8ad932bf6f4d0e052b32a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6125ee49e9153fb4b54bb70ae56be103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70958e41947f1856a02ce9f16c9fc2d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86656548de9bfd0478a2d1b0fe96d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841174697e4d1adb00807b4c235dad95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4efb79385162ec030f628dd53195cda1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56f6dc568e975b991ef77fef2b87308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bca68d15e92b884efd92720e2c7854b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f834e8b7d7d03a36035b0e78ec04286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42459c9f4aed311ed314d3fc91766340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfdc17b58a9995d6e89b17c17bad0e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66b63600e03092a5ca1c679f8f843d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444ca2b0650b4f2ceb3c82343611968e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64ef5b105da295a0d80cfd3580be9c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c53c7a599fb091954200aad1210eb82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd06fcac9c35ac7b8214e3071ed275a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0e4ec39b25d6db8b5b1e0c721b2754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753a7ed896a229ef5f44ed6c498cbd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62eb392517072085e7cc966fc793312b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe59d78b7f30a5635c0de425f655d571&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b39a557e445658829217fe6071239fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c34859ba6ebac9e5c64e24bf779250ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ea6561085c9fb8326503d1574198c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc2d05ad9613f280438ab5c7cc47980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5919b394f61097b3c448dfb4508004c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c387496e1939b9dacb1d90fdd6a53535&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d789cac2fbcd408ecf4c33f215039d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa8a0533ff9128b6afab4fc093e281b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3450ba5bfe3386a0c6435df02b3bcbf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d776982364dc89bd130a2d3605148e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8fb1e80c6588d63904d0fbfbe52f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe</data>
