    <node id="Piattaforma Digitale">
      <data key="d0">Piattaforma Digitale</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Piattaforma Digitale is a digital platform utilized by the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS, serving as a crucial system for managing registrations and communications with registered entities concerning cybersecurity. It facilitates effective communication and interaction between the regulated subjects and the NIS authority, allowing these entities to transmit and update information related to their activities and services. This technological solution is essential for compliance purposes, enabling entities to engage with the NIS authority and ensuring that they can update their information as required. Overall, the Piattaforma Digitale encapsulates the digital interface through which vital communication and information management take place, reinforcing the operational framework surrounding cybersecurity and compliance in the relevant sectors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484df9d473d54e589fa3c8ffe837ea7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb94e6dd2cff7234a13092b3648708ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d789cac2fbcd408ecf4c33f215039d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3450ba5bfe3386a0c6435df02b3bcbf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753a7ed896a229ef5f44ed6c498cbd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86656548de9bfd0478a2d1b0fe96d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f628afacbf45a56e2ceb0c53612e2da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_31.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_34.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Attività">
      <data key="d0">Attività</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Attività refers to the various activities undertaken by essential and important subjects that must be reported to the competent authority.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Servizi">
      <data key="d0">Servizi</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Servizi encompasses the services offered by essential and important subjects that need to be characterized and categorized as required by the regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Tavoli Settoriali">
      <data key="d0">Tavoli Settoriali</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">I Tavoli Settoriali sono gruppi di lavoro delicati a settori specifici, utilizzati per facilitare la cooperazione e l'attuazione delle politiche.&lt;SEP&gt;I tavoli settoriali sono gruppi di lavoro che supportano l'Autorità nazionale competente NIS nelle sue funzioni di supervisione.&lt;SEP&gt;Tavoli Settoriali refers to sectoral tables that the Autorità nazionale competente NIS can utilize for better compliance support.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-24680fdd6d24ab9a12ee08ca699800d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f628afacbf45a56e2ceb0c53612e2da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097b04a09e0b581c1371bf708d2c9385</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_35.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Termine">
      <data key="d0">Termine</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Il termine è un periodo di tempo stabilito entro il quale deve avvenire il riscontro e la convalida da parte dell'Autorità.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-097b04a09e0b581c1371bf708d2c9385</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Informazioni Aggiuntive">
      <data key="d0">Informazioni Aggiuntive</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Le informazioni aggiuntive sono dati e integrazioni richiesti dall'Autorità per effettuare valutazioni complete.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-097b04a09e0b581c1371bf708d2c9385</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Comma 2">
      <data key="d0">Comma 2</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Comma 2 indicates a specific subsection within Articolo 7 that details important subjects related to the implementation of the NIS Directive.&lt;SEP&gt;Il Comma 2 si riferisce a una parte della normativa che descrive le condizioni per l'attuazione degli interventi di supporto.&lt;SEP&gt;Il comma 2 si riferisce a una specifica disposizione normativa riguardante i termini e le modalità di convalida.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-24680fdd6d24ab9a12ee08ca699800d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097b04a09e0b581c1371bf708d2c9385</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_35.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Comma 3">
      <data key="d0">Comma 3</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Comma 3 is a subsection of Article 13 that mandates specific reporting requirements related to national cyber response plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Comma 3 pertains to the procedures for designating representatives as stipulated by the NIS Directive within Articolo 5.&lt;SEP&gt;Il comma 3 stabilisce le condizioni per la convalida della conformità qualora non si ricevano riscontri.&lt;SEP&gt;Il comma 3 è una parte della normativa che specifica le comunicazioni che i soggetti devono inviare all'Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-753a7ed896a229ef5f44ed6c498cbd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9490309e2fc520894aac16ef2d39a46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097b04a09e0b581c1371bf708d2c9385</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_7.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Comma 4">
      <data key="d0">Comma 4</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Comma 4 indicates additional information that subjects must provide as per the regulations outlined in Articolo 7.&lt;SEP&gt;Il comma 4 prevede le modalità di proroga dei termini per la convalida delle informazioni.&lt;SEP&gt;Comma 4 is another subsection of Article 13 detailing further requirements for national incident response strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Il comma 4 è una sezione normativa che stabilisce requisiti di informazione per i soggetti nell'Unione Europea.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-753a7ed896a229ef5f44ed6c498cbd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9490309e2fc520894aac16ef2d39a46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097b04a09e0b581c1371bf708d2c9385</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_7.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CSIRT Italia">
      <data key="d0">CSIRT Italia</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">CSIRT Italia is the Italian Computer Security Incident Response Team, responsible for handling incidents and providing assistance in national cybersecurity matters.&lt;SEP&gt;CSIRT Italia is the Italian Computer Security Incident Response Team, responsible for managing cybersecurity incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;CSIRT Italia is the national Computer Security Incident Response Team for Italy, tasked with managing cybersecurity incidents and enhancing the country's overall security posture. Operating under the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale, CSIRT Italia plays a pivotal role in responding to significant cybersecurity threats, particularly for essential and important entities that are at a higher risk of such incidents.

The organization is dedicated to coordinating and sharing crucial cybersecurity information, offering technical assistance, and formulating appropriate responses to major incidents. Part of its responsibilities includes engaging in vulnerability coordination, collaborating with other national CSIRTs across EU member states to establish itself as a trusted intermediary for the coordinated disclosure of vulnerabilities. This process ensures effective communication between those reporting vulnerabilities and the relevant manufacturers or service providers.

In its operational efforts, CSIRT Italia actively monitors and analyzes cybersecurity threats, vulnerabilities, and incidents at a national level, assisting both public and private stakeholders. It is committed to ensuring a prompt and effective response to crises and incidents, thereby reinforcing its role as a vital resource for tackling the cybersecurity challenges pertinent to Italy. Through international collaboration, CSIRT Italia further enhances its abilities to manage cybersecurity incidents and threats effectively, solidifying its position as a key player in the broader cybersecurity landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;CSIRT Italia is the national group responsible for responding to cybersecurity incidents in Italy, operating within the National Cybersecurity Agency.&lt;SEP&gt;CSIRT Italia is the national team responsible for responding to cybersecurity incidents in Italy, operating within the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c62341e6dbdcf3426bec3e9017f906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b069a2848ec3f27bf4ee85e079a65b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f4f98b1c2d2070c1c1800937a75e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b824e0b89de2a1e27b0589d38a4cd97d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa1ba88b9694d7fe4e3a6702f075c4c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6f2ee79d69b2e0e0b40a96b7e26f33e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb35bd367b636533a9fb6889ae8c322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f08baf276ad5e5d006bc1e3ffc1cda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-823e4bcb44a0430e6bbba96d50184704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aff85b17effe0512dfd9b859f55af04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841174697e4d1adb00807b4c235dad95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c4f103bc5263a7ed18ca930ed8b9da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e4324dfac9792a4d9eef15127f75b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3116d335c306732798ce61c729fe9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ff7d744f17e74ad5f97cec6205c467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dff57220606107f074f3f461176a191e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bffd59c74e18fdeb464f491380f5fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0e4ec39b25d6db8b5b1e0c721b2754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c6c883c71e0ab508dd69753b4dba4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4864bc6c963ba7a38620beb8b978ba44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec85a32073c7d50fe528ce38d609671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-889438fb9a3aca977f824f903bd07e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e0e75c3b7d45965634f03b7bc21efd</data>
