    </node>
    <node id="Incidente Significativo">
      <data key="d0">Incidente Significativo</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An incident is considered significant if it causes operational disruption or financial loss and may impact other individuals or entities.&lt;SEP&gt;Incidente Significativo refers to a significant incident that requires timely notification and assessment of its impact and severity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ff7d744f17e74ad5f97cec6205c467</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Incidente">
      <data key="d0">Incidente</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An incident is any event that may have a notable impact on service delivery, requiring timely notification to CSIRT Italia.&lt;SEP&gt;Incidente è un evento che compromette la disponibilità, l'integrità o la riservatezza dei dati e dei servizi offerti dai sistemi.&lt;SEP&gt;Un Incidente è un evento che compromette la disponibilità, l'integrità o la riservatezza dei dati nei sistemi informativi e di rete.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ffa3df8decb742aba92a8f1157aabf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ff7d744f17e74ad5f97cec6205c467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73766bc5881d3a614c830be383735389</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Notifica">
      <data key="d0">Notifica</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Notifica is a formal notification that must be submitted within a specified time frame after becoming aware of a significant incident, updating details about the incident's nature and impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifica is a report that must be submitted to CSIRT Italia regarding significant incidents, including initial assessments and updates.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ff7d744f17e74ad5f97cec6205c467</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Servizi Fiduciari">
      <data key="d0">Servizi Fiduciari</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Servizi Fiduciari refers to fiduciary services that must notify CSIRT Italia promptly in case of significant incidents affecting their provision.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Incidenti Significativi">
      <data key="d0">Incidenti Significativi</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Incidenti Significativi refers to significant incidents or breaches that trigger specific enforcement actions from the cybersecurity authority.&lt;SEP&gt;Incidenti Significativi refers to significant incidents that must be reported by public administration entities, emphasizing the importance of transparency and accountability.&lt;SEP&gt;Incidenti Significativi refers to significant incidents that require prompt notification and assessment of their severity and impact on services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e0e543505f46f01058efe5376e16f1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c53c7a599fb091954200aad1210eb82</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_34.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Pre-notifica">
      <data key="d0">Pre-notifica</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Pre-notifica is a preliminary notification that indicates whether a significant incident may result from illicit acts or may have a cross-border impact.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Fiduciary Services">
      <data key="d0">Fiduciary Services</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fiduciary Services refer to services that are required to notify CSIRT Italia of any significant incidents that may affect their operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Misure di Attenuazione">
      <data key="d0">Misure di Attenuazione</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Misure di Attenuazione refers to mitigation measures implemented to address and manage the effects of significant incidents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Gravità">
      <data key="d0">Gravità</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Gravità refers to the severity level of a significant incident, which is assessed during the notification process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41c77d850f8edc93d613aea7d4fe8be0</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Autorità di contrasto">
      <data key="d0">Autorità di contrasto</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Autorità di contrasto is an authority involved in countering crime and ensuring the regularity of telecommunications services in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;Autorità di contrasto is the authority responsible for ensuring security and compliance in telecommunications as per Italian law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-114b1362fb84968e146ca23e283cba2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="incidente significativo">
      <data key="d0">incidente significativo</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Incidenti significativi refer to significant incidents that impact service delivery and require immediate reporting and management measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Un incidente significativo è un evento che può avere un impatto serio sulla fornitura di servizi e richiede un'azione correttiva immediata.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe59d78b7f30a5635c0de425f655d571</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
