      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Misure di attenuazione indicates the mitigation measures adopted to address significant incidents and minimize their impact on services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="notifica">
      <data key="d0">notifica</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Notifica refers to the process of notifying relevant parties about significant incidents as per regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="prestatore di servizi fiduciari">
      <data key="d0">prestatore di servizi fiduciari</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Prestatore di servizi fiduciari refers to a service provider that must notify of any significant incidents affecting its services within a stipulated time frame.&lt;SEP&gt;Un prestatore di servizi fiduciari è una persona fisica o giuridica che fornisce servizi fiduciari.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eb90921644ffffadb05538947b578b77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8</data>
