    </node>
    <node id="riscontro iniziale">
      <data key="d0">riscontro iniziale</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Riscontro iniziale refers to the initial response provided by CSIRT Italia upon the notification of a significant incident.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="consultazione">
      <data key="d0">consultazione</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Consultazione denotes the guidance or advice that CSIRT Italia offers regarding technical mitigation measures during significant incidents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-254ee914ac45de30371bd33583eeb7f8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="incidenti significativi">
      <data key="d0">incidenti significativi</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Gli incidenti significativi sono eventi rilevanti che possono influenzare la fornitura dei servizi e richiedono comunicazioni tempestive ai destinatari.&lt;SEP&gt;Incidenti significativi are significant cybersecurity incidents that must be reported, as stipulated in the regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Incidenti significativi refer to significant cyber incidents that require notification and mitigation measures to be implemented.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe59d78b7f30a5635c0de425f655d571</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="soggetto notificante">
      <data key="d0">soggetto notificante</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Soggetto notificante refers to the individual or organization that reports a significant cyber incident to CSIRT Italia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="soggetti essenziali">
      <data key="d0">soggetti essenziali</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Soggetti essenziali, or essential subjects, are organizations and entities in Italy that are mandated to comply with cybersecurity regulations and agreements due to their critical role in national infrastructure and service maintenance. These entities are integral to ensuring the security and integrity of information systems and networks, as they provide vital services that impact the overall cybersecurity landscape.

Regularly informed about incidents and notifications, soggetti essenziali are monitored closely by relevant authorities, including CSIRT Italia, to ensure they remain equipped to respond effectively to cybersecurity threats. It is also crucial for these entities to communicate significant incidents that could affect their service provision to the European Commission, underlining their responsibility in cybersecurity practices and incident management.

In addition to adhering to stringent cybersecurity assessments that aim to identify vulnerabilities and enhance security measures, soggetti essenziali may face monetary sanctions for non-compliance, which are calculated based on their global annual turnover. Notably, these essential entities are distinct from public administrations, as they are subjected to specific regulations that enforce compliance and impose fines when necessary.

Overall, soggetti essenziali exemplify the critical importance of certain organizations in upholding national security and resilience against cyber threats, requiring substantial support and engagement in ongoing risk management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-20c6c883c71e0ab508dd69753b4dba4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf144b59d369b803a5424bb50e1533b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad1b4a2fb2981185e478a01df6796b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bffd59c74e18fdeb464f491380f5fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd470b0d0545e260b3ec4b4200485ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26bbb300d251c26612092b2e60977328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f08baf276ad5e5d006bc1e3ffc1cda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66b63600e03092a5ca1c679f8f843d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e0e75c3b7d45965634f03b7bc21efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec85a32073c7d50fe528ce38d609671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-889438fb9a3aca977f824f903bd07e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aff85b17effe0512dfd9b859f55af04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3574f28f12a3390bb92440df5eda9ca</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_15.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_34.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="soggetti importanti">
      <data key="d0">soggetti importanti</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Soggetti importanti, or important subjects, refer to significant entities within the cybersecurity landscape that, while not always classified as essential, play a crucial role in maintaining the security of information systems and networks. These entities are involved in cybersecurity compliance and have specific responsibilities, including the obligation to report significant incidents based on their situational context. They are integral to the notification process and must align with existing regulatory frameworks.

These important subjects receive periodic or timely information regarding cybersecurity incidents and are essential for monitoring and communication. Their influence and impact on cybersecurity may also result in them being subject to oversight and assessment. Additionally, soggetti importanti have financial implications, as they face monetary sanctions under regulatory frameworks, albeit at different rates compared to essential subjects. Importantly, they do not include public administrations, which are subject to different standards.

Moreover, soggetti importanti are positioned to receive support from CSIRT Italia for various cybersecurity-related concerns, highlighting their pivotal role in enhancing the security posture of their respective environments. In summary, soggetti importanti represent a vital component of the governance and security measures in cybersecurity protocols and activities, necessitating attention and protection to strengthen overall cybersecurity efforts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-20c6c883c71e0ab508dd69753b4dba4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf144b59d369b803a5424bb50e1533b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad1b4a2fb2981185e478a01df6796b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bffd59c74e18fdeb464f491380f5fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd470b0d0545e260b3ec4b4200485ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26bbb300d251c26612092b2e60977328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f08baf276ad5e5d006bc1e3ffc1cda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66b63600e03092a5ca1c679f8f843d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e0e75c3b7d45965634f03b7bc21efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec85a32073c7d50fe528ce38d609671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-889438fb9a3aca977f824f903bd07e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aff85b17effe0512dfd9b859f55af04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3574f28f12a3390bb92440df5eda9ca</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_15.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_34.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="minaccia informatica significativa">
      <data key="d0">minaccia informatica significativa</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Minaccia informatica significativa refers to a significant cyber threat that may affect essential services and requires communication of mitigation measures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1</data>
