    <node id="decreto">
      <data key="d0">decreto</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Decreto refers to a legislative or regulatory decree that outlines specific obligations and processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Il decreto è un atto normativo che definisce le modalità di attuazione della disciplina NIS.&lt;SEP&gt;The decreto is a set of regulations or legal provisions that outline obligations and requirements for compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The decreto refers to a specific government decree that outlines regulations and procedures for sectoral implementation and monitoring.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a9e8d96b5144e4e7bea4d0b4800c03b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aeea7f868e572ca2683710a23021720&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a729088f240d55c4f47ccab984e08335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0618e63c2780519a80b84cddf2cf6315</data>
