    <node id="Audit sulla Sicurezza">
      <data key="d0">Audit sulla Sicurezza</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Audit sulla Sicurezza are security audits designed to evaluate and ensure compliance with cybersecurity measures and detect potential security incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Audit sulla Sicurezza refers to periodic and targeted security audits performed by independent bodies based on risk assessments by the NIS.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e0e543505f46f01058efe5376e16f1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c53c7a599fb091954200aad1210eb82</data>
