      <data key="d0">Istruzioni Vincolanti</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Istruzioni Vincolanti are binding instructions issued by the Autorità Nazionale Competente that require compliance from public administration entities.&lt;SEP&gt;Istruzioni Vincolanti are mandatory instructions issued by the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS that organizations must follow to comply with cybersecurity policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e0e543505f46f01058efe5376e16f1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c53c7a599fb091954200aad1210eb82</data>
