      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decrees from the President of the Council of Ministers pertain to the formal establishment of regulations regarding cybersecurity and public administration compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Decreto del Presidente del Consiglio dei ministri outlines the criteria, procedures, and modalities for cybersecurity activities and powers.</data>
