    <node id="Ministri">
      <data key="d0">Ministri</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ministri are Italian ministers responsible for proposing legislative actions, including those related to cybersecurity framework adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Ministri refers to the ministers involved in the decision-making process related to the establishment of criteria, procedures, and activities as stipulated.</data>
