    <node id="Decreto sulla cybersicurezza">
      <data key="d0">Decreto sulla cybersicurezza</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Il Decreto sulla cybersicurezza stabilisce misure per garantire la sicurezza informatica a livello nazionale e nell'Unione Europea.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Decreto">
      <data key="d0">Decreto</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decreto refers to formal decrees issued by the President of the Council of Ministers, aimed at establishing regulations for cybersecurity at both the national level and within the European Union. It outlines measures designed to ensure a high level of cybersecurity, establishing obligations and risk management measures for cybersecurity incidents. Furthermore, Decreto serves as a regulatory framework introduced to manage specific measures related to national security and cybersecurity. It provides comprehensive guidelines and regulations applicable to sector-specific subjects in the field of cybersecurity, aligning with the application of the EU regulation (EU) 2022/2554. The provisions of Decreto are relevant to both public and private entities under national jurisdiction, setting forth rules that govern their operations and responsibilities concerning cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Il decreto si riferisce a disposizioni relative allo scambio volontario di informazioni sulla sicurezza informatica.&lt;SEP&gt;The Decreto pertains to the legislation that mandates activities and information sharing related to cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Il Decreto stabilisce le linee guida e i criteri per l'identificazione delle categorie di soggetti nel contesto della sicurezza e amministrazione pubblica.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8dd112d6d7123fa65b6dbdc301dfb1d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e98ccfb24c51cc4a0c53d01fb908d7aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004703168628c6aaccaf0aac8aed014f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd470b0d0545e260b3ec4b4200485ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f4f98b1c2d2070c1c1800937a75e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63558da7213d315905329b4e57635655&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16cdb0f718bbae3b971310034145dced&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6125ee49e9153fb4b54bb70ae56be103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-918a3c8c9a0bb2f72084c1d4a4433b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1438f57bb8c01c2bc53a9597dce8694f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_6.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Strategia nazionale di cybersicurezza">
      <data key="d0">Strategia nazionale di cybersicurezza</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">La Strategia nazionale di cybersicurezza stabilisce le linee guida per la sicurezza informatica in Italia e deve essere trasmessa alla Commissione europea.&lt;SEP&gt;La Strategia nazionale di cybersicurezza è un insieme di linee guida e misure per garantire un'elevata sicurezza informatica in Italia.&lt;SEP&gt;The Strategia nazionale di cybersicurezza outlines the framework for cybersecurity measures and practices in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Strategia nazionale di cybersicurezza refers to Italy's national strategy aimed at safeguarding cybersecurity, which is assessed and updated periodically.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3574f28f12a3390bb92440df5eda9ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4afbcc356a5cad070006284b04c6eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ac85b75b9a0982916688ed2e7a5268</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Quadro di gestione delle crisi informatiche">
      <data key="d0">Quadro di gestione delle crisi informatiche</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Il Quadro di gestione delle crisi informatiche è un sistema organizzativo concepito per affrontare situazioni di emergenza legate alla sicurezza informatica.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97</data>
