    <node id="Articolo 10 del decreto-legge 4 giugno 2021, n. 82">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 10 del decreto-legge 4 giugno 2021, n. 82</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Questo articolo del decreto-legge riguarda la gestione delle crisi informatiche e la responsabilità delle autorità nazionali competenti.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Autorità nazionale competente NIS">
      <data key="d0">Autorità nazionale competente NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Autorità nazionale competente NIS is the national competent authority in Italy tasked with overseeing the implementation and enforcement of the NIS Directive (Directive (EU) 2018/1972), which emphasizes network and information security. This authority manages cybersecurity and telecommunications regulations and is responsible for registering essential and important entities as required by specific articles of recently established regulations. 

Its primary function includes ensuring that these entities comply with relevant security standards. The Autorità nazionale competente NIS can issue binding guidelines and recommendations regarding compliance obligations, and it possesses the authority to suspend deadlines when necessary. 

In carrying out its regulatory role, the authority collaborates with various stakeholders to enforce compliance with the NIS Directive, while also coordinating national cybersecurity measures. Additionally, the Autorità nazionale competente NIS oversees incident response and security in information systems, facilitating communication by determining and notifying relevant parties about incidents. It also provides support during inspection activities and maintains consultations with regulatory counterparts from other EU member states.

The authority advocates for the adoption of European and international technical specifications to enhance the security of information and network systems. Furthermore, it establishes a national policy for the coordinated disclosure of vulnerabilities and strives to bolster Italy's overall cybersecurity resilience while promoting qualified trust services within the broader cybersecurity framework. Overall, the Autorità nazionale competente NIS plays a crucial role in ensuring compliance with cybersecurity regulations, including those related to administrative sanctions and information updates.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b063d4fa6a2db553615300cf62e775bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe9d12702503967b563f73226bd6c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0618e63c2780519a80b84cddf2cf6315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26bbb300d251c26612092b2e60977328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ceda7e1e5e4925ac0d4f0b61bcc3f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d94ce1991a6e4ab6550c5f7d133849c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484df9d473d54e589fa3c8ffe837ea7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b528329b76b06e8a0993b8b1545fb6f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aff85b17effe0512dfd9b859f55af04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3479c45042cc5104295d8eeb9779399e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e4324dfac9792a4d9eef15127f75b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc6cb82fc59fd64c26c25aeeb268218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b2b06654771f3fbd63686d25bafd39a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e5212ab2d4a732b547eae6f0a381bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23a0918358a7732eec078565600a96b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114b1362fb84968e146ca23e283cba2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53b540306cae3f5d4ac372c47e02440&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a729088f240d55c4f47ccab984e08335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff824a8d4fd7ac945910f70fbbda425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec85a32073c7d50fe528ce38d609671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e0e75c3b7d45965634f03b7bc21efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f628afacbf45a56e2ceb0c53612e2da8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_16.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_39.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_31.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_27.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_12.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Punto di contatto unico NIS">
      <data key="d0">Punto di contatto unico NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Punto di contatto unico NIS is a designated entity in Italy responsible for facilitating communication and cooperation among national authorities in the realm of network and information security. It operates as a single point of contact for cybersecurity coordination, specifically established under the NIS directive, which aims to enhance cybersecurity across the European Union. This entity plays a crucial role in fostering transboundary cooperation among national authorities on cybersecurity issues and is tasked with ensuring effective communication between competent authorities. By serving as a central hub, the Punto di contatto unico NIS supports the implementation of the NIS directive in Italy and coordinates interactions with the European Commission, thereby strengthening the overall cybersecurity framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a09a98f23c165c2285989df098e2deae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c92e8c6868003608beac05c39d102b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Nucleo per la cybersicurezza">
      <data key="d0">Nucleo per la cybersicurezza</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Il Nucleo per la cybersicurezza è un'unità operativa che si occupa di vigilare e gestire le crisi informatiche.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cybersecurity Core is a body responsible for various tasks related to cybersecurity in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nucleo per la cybersicurezza is a body within the Italian government tasked with supporting the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale and contributing to cybersecurity strategies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4afbcc356a5cad070006284b04c6eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Autorità di settore NIS">
      <data key="d0">Autorità di settore NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Le Autorità di settore NIS sono enti che supportano l'Autorità nazionale competente NIS nel recepimento e nell'implementazione delle politiche di sicurezza informatica.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità di settore NIS, or NIS Sector Authorities, refers to sector-specific entities in Italy that are tasked with ensuring compliance and security under the NIS (Network and Information Systems) directive. These authorities play a crucial role in the governance and oversight of cybersecurity practices within their respective domains, which encompass various sectors and subsectors. They are responsible for regulating and monitoring organizations to ensure adherence to data protection measures as stipulated by specific regulations.

Furthermore, the Autorità di settore NIS collaborate closely with the National Cybersecurity Agency, providing support in the management of cybersecurity measures and guidelines. Their designation is aimed at enhancing the resilience of the infrastructures they oversee, thereby contributing to improved overall cybersecurity standards in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità di settore NIS refers to national authorities responsible for overseeing cybersecurity measures related to network and information systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità di settore NIS includes different authorities responsible for specific sectors as outlined in the NIS Directive, contributing representatives to the Tavolo.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità di settore NIS consists of designated authorities responsible for overseeing specific sectors under the NIS directive, ensuring compliance and security.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3116d335c306732798ce61c729fe9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602ea72e3655b7b15fdf906e18f7a516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23a0918358a7732eec078565600a96b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d94ce1991a6e4ab6550c5f7d133849c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004703168628c6aaccaf0aac8aed014f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004dccf05c9434c44fb95414cf704e85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8b7f52f808d1b9c8258f9c2df76552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-823e4bcb44a0430e6bbba96d50184704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_8.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_12.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Gruppo di intervento nazionale per la sicurezza informatica (CSIRT Italia)">
      <data key="d0">Gruppo di intervento nazionale per la sicurezza informatica (CSIRT Italia)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">CSIRT Italia is a national intervention group responsible for cybersecurity incidents within Italy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Rete delle organizzazioni di collegamento per le crisi informatiche (EU-CyCLONe)">
      <data key="d0">Rete delle organizzazioni di collegamento per le crisi informatiche (EU-CyCLONe)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">EU-CyCLONe is a network aimed at supporting coordinated management of large-scale cybersecurity incidents across EU states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Rete di CSIRT nazionali">
      <data key="d0">Rete di CSIRT nazionali</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Rete di CSIRT nazionali is a network of national CSIRTs (Computer Security Incident Response Teams) established under EU directive 2022/2555.&lt;SEP&gt;Rete di CSIRT nazionali refers to the network of national CSIRTs established by the EU for collaborative incident management and information sharing.&lt;SEP&gt;The National CSIRT Network is a collaborative framework among various national CSIRTs aiming to enhance collective cybersecurity efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rete di CSIRT nazionali is a robust network of national Computer Security Incident Response Teams dedicated to fostering rapid and effective technical cooperation in the management of cybersecurity incidents. This organization aims to facilitate collaboration and coordinated responses to cybersecurity threats among member states, ensuring information exchange and promoting best practices.

The network consists of teams that are focused on incident response, security incident management, and enhancing preparedness against cyber threats. By working together, these teams share critical information, methodologies, and reporting mechanisms to improve their collective readiness for addressing cybersecurity challenges.

Overall, the Rete di CSIRT nazionali plays a vital role in strengthening cybersecurity resilience by enabling national teams to work in unison, thereby improving their capacity to manage and mitigate incidents effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ddea58f25d264feccb012f5bdeeb220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8377fe9a87e8f911c762411e7d09fbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f08baf276ad5e5d006bc1e3ffc1cda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b824e0b89de2a1e27b0589d38a4cd97d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a27aa8d0bb3182a3820bfb4881cd0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d94ce1991a6e4ab6550c5f7d133849c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15746586d8c2b78380d00c1c0f232f1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-918a3c8c9a0bb2f72084c1d4a4433b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_19.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_15.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_20.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Gruppo di intervento nazionale per la sicurezza informatica in caso di incidente in ambito nazionale (CSIRT Italia)">
      <data key="d0">Gruppo di intervento nazionale per la sicurezza informatica in caso di incidente in ambito nazionale (CSIRT Italia)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">CSIRT Italia is a national intervention group responsible for responding to cybersecurity incidents in Italy, coordinating efforts among various stakeholders.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Autorità nazionali di gestione delle crisi informatiche">
      <data key="d0">Autorità nazionali di gestione delle crisi informatiche</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">National authorities designated to manage large-scale cybersecurity crises, ensuring coordinated responses and strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità nazionali di gestione delle crisi informatiche are the national authorities responsible for identifying capabilities, resources, and procedures in the event of a cybersecurity crisis.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità nazionali di gestione delle crisi informatiche are the national authorities tasked with managing large-scale cybersecurity incidents and crises in line with NIS directives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b762ae6bc9abced0fc47e1227f90166b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EU-CyCLONe">
      <data key="d0">EU-CyCLONe</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">EU-CyCLONe is a strategic initiative of the European Union designed to enhance cooperation in managing cybersecurity incidents and to improve overall cybersecurity within the EU. It serves as a network of organizations linked to crisis management in cybersecurity, aimed at facilitating an effective response to cyber incidents. Established by EU directive 2022/2555, EU-CyCLONe supports the operational management of cybersecurity crises by fostering the exchange of best practices among its members. The network is focused on addressing emerging issues in cybersecurity and is dedicated to bolstering the collaborative efforts of its participants in the mitigation of cyber incidents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b824e0b89de2a1e27b0589d38a4cd97d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d94ce1991a6e4ab6550c5f7d133849c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-918a3c8c9a0bb2f72084c1d4a4433b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62eb392517072085e7cc966fc793312b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b39a557e445658829217fe6071239fa6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Sicurezza Informatica">
      <data key="d0">Sicurezza Informatica</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sicurezza Informatica refers to a comprehensive set of practices and protocols designed to protect information systems and data from various cyber threats and incidents. It encompasses activities aimed at safeguarding computer systems and networks against attacks, vulnerabilities, and potential risks such as information disclosure, theft, or damage to hardware, software, or data. Moreover, Sicurezza Informatica involves the implementation of measures essential for cybersecurity management within organizations that are considered important or critical as per regulatory decrees. Overall, it highlights the proactive steps necessary to uphold the security and integrity of digital environments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ffa3df8decb742aba92a8f1157aabf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70f0567946102de362e38795f66fb304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b373dba81d31204e726d5f7176f6043e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf8de775b62187a961a092f019a565ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-918a3c8c9a0bb2f72084c1d4a4433b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79110363e2fdbfe3d29b375599dab210</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_32.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Incidenti Cibernetici">
      <data key="d0">Incidenti Cibernetici</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Incidenti Cibernetici refer to events that compromise the confidentiality, integrity, or availability of information systems or data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-918a3c8c9a0bb2f72084c1d4a4433b57</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="cooperazione">
      <data key="d0">cooperazione</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Cooperazione refers to a collaborative effort, often aimed at achieving shared goals in various domains, including technical fields.&lt;SEP&gt;Cooperazione refers to the collaborative efforts among various stakeholders to enhance cybersecurity at the national level.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-823e4bcb44a0430e6bbba96d50184704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab7a77a3520d38cce61e3bab9c0eddb7</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json</data>
