      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fornitori di Servizi di Cloud Computing refers to cloud service providers involved in managing infrastructure and services compliant with the outlined regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;I Fornitori di Servizi di Cloud Computing offrono storage e capacità di elaborazione attraverso la rete, garantendo accesso remoto ai dati.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-484df9d473d54e589fa3c8ffe837ea7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c35a9cee97ca2d6904cdecfa96ae491</data>
