    </node>
    <node id="Soggetti">
      <data key="d0">Soggetti</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">I soggetti si riferiscono a enti o persone che offrono servizi all'interno dell'Unione Europea e sono soggetti a giurisdizione.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti pertains to the entities or subjects that are affected or governed by the regulations and standards specified in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti refers to entities or subjects that are defined and regulated under the legislative decree, ensuring compliance with essential service standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti is an organization ensuring a level of cybersecurity compliance with specific legal obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cf8de775b62187a961a092f019a565ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1438f57bb8c01c2bc53a9597dce8694f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b373dba81d31204e726d5f7176f6043e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42459c9f4aed311ed314d3fc91766340</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_32.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_5.json</data>
    </node>
