    </node>
    <node id="Obblighi">
      <data key="d0">Obblighi</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Obblighi refers to the legal responsibilities that entities must adhere to under the regulations set forth by the Union for cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Obblighi refers to the specific duties and responsibilities outlined in legal articles related to cybersecurity compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Obblighi translates to obligations and duties that entities must adhere to under specific regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cc2d05ad9613f280438ab5c7cc47980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b373dba81d31204e726d5f7176f6043e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42459c9f4aed311ed314d3fc91766340</data>
