      <data key="d0">Unione europea</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">L'Unione europea is a political and economic union of member states located primarily in Europe, aiming to ensure free movement of people, goods, services, and capital.&lt;SEP&gt;Unione europea refers to the political and economic union of member countries in Europe that governs the rules regarding data protection rights.</data>
