    <node id="Tavolo per l'attuazione della disciplina NIS">
      <data key="d0">Tavolo per l'attuazione della disciplina NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Tavolo per l'attuazione della disciplina NIS is an essential body established in Italy to support the national competent authority in effectively implementing the NIS (Network and Information Systems) directive. This collaborative working group plays a crucial role in ensuring coordination among various stakeholders involved in the governance of cybersecurity standards and practices within the country. As a permanent entity, the Tavolo meets periodically to discuss and carry out its mandate related to the NIS directive, focusing on the implementation of specific regulations and frameworks aimed at enhancing cybersecurity protocols. Through its efforts, the Tavolo aims to promote and streamline the governance of cybersecurity regulations across different sectors in Italy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d008e433ea6328598c9f502f5b2a9875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3116d335c306732798ce61c729fe9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23a0918358a7732eec078565600a96b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004703168628c6aaccaf0aac8aed014f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a729088f240d55c4f47ccab984e08335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_12.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Piattaforma digitale">
      <data key="d0">Piattaforma digitale</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Piattaforma digitale is a digital platform where certain service providers must register as part of compliance with the NIS regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_42.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Soggetti essenziali">
      <data key="d0">Soggetti essenziali</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Soggetti essenziali are essential subjects that play a crucial role in particular sectors and are subject to specific legal obligations under Italian law.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti essenziali refers to essential entities that are subject to regulatory frameworks and potential sanctions.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti essenziali refers to essential subjects involved in agreements for information sharing on cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti essenziali, or essential entities, are critical organizations that play a vital role in maintaining national security and public service provision. These entities are required to implement robust cybersecurity measures and comply with specific regulations established by the NIS directive. They must conform to cybersecurity norms and utilize certified TIC products and services. Supported by CSIRT Italia, these essential entities are subject to stringent obligations aimed at safeguarding their operations and ensuring the security of the services they provide.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8fb35bd367b636533a9fb6889ae8c322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004703168628c6aaccaf0aac8aed014f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26bbb300d251c26612092b2e60977328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a09a98f23c165c2285989df098e2deae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa1ba88b9694d7fe4e3a6702f075c4c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b528329b76b06e8a0993b8b1545fb6f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e0e75c3b7d45965634f03b7bc21efd</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_15.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Soggetti importanti">
      <data key="d0">Soggetti importanti</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Soggetti importanti are important subjects defined under legal frameworks that have significant impact and responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti importanti refers to important entities that, while not classified as essential, have a significant impact on society and are therefore subject to security requirements. These entities are considered significant alongside essential entities, both of which must adhere to the regulations of the NIS directive regarding cybersecurity. Their participation is crucial for the implementation of cybersecurity protocols, as they play a vital role within the cybersecurity framework and actively interact with CSIRT Italia. Additionally, soggetti importanti are involved in various cybersecurity agreements, underlining their importance in safeguarding digital infrastructures and promoting overall cybersecurity initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti importanti refers to significant subjects that are monitored and inspected by L'Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti importanti refers to significant entities that are mandated to comply with rules and may face penalties for violations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8fb35bd367b636533a9fb6889ae8c322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26bbb300d251c26612092b2e60977328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a09a98f23c165c2285989df098e2deae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa1ba88b9694d7fe4e3a6702f075c4c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd06fcac9c35ac7b8214e3071ed275a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b528329b76b06e8a0993b8b1545fb6f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e0e75c3b7d45965634f03b7bc21efd</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_36.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_15.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Obbligo di registrazione">
      <data key="d0">Obbligo di registrazione</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Obbligo di registrazione refers to the event that mandates the registration of various service providers on the digital platform as part of NIS compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_42.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Fase di prima applicazione">
      <data key="d0">Fase di prima applicazione</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Fase di prima applicazione refers to the initial phase of implementation for compliance with regulations outlined in the NIS directive, detailing registration and obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_42.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 7">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 7</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Articolo 7 defines specific obligations for service providers under the NIS directive, including registration and compliance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 7 refers to a specific article within the legal framework outlining regulations related to cybersecurity and information sharing.&lt;SEP&gt;L'Articolo 7 del decreto prevede l'elenco di soggetti di cui le Autorità di settore devono occuparsi.&lt;SEP&gt;L'Articolo 7 riguarda le specifiche obbligazioni legali relative alla sicurezza informatica da parte delle entità in questione.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 7 refers to a specific provision within the legal text concerning penalties for violations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b56f6dc568e975b991ef77fef2b87308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edcb0cfb3d603a54ef204d72849d9e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8b7f52f808d1b9c8258f9c2df76552</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 12">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 12</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Articolo 12 details the processes for organizing and implementing the NIS Directive regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 12 outlines the meeting requirements for the Tavolo per l'attuazione della disciplina NIS during the implementation phase.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cb0751ea9b752da31add0e157217c185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 25">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 25</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 25 details the requirements for the reporting of incidents, ensuring organizations maintain necessary cybersecurity practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 25 sets deadlines for compliance obligations following the communication from the regulatory authority.&lt;SEP&gt;L'Articolo 25 del Decreto Legislativo stabilisce gli obblighi di notifica di incidenti per le entità soggette alla sicurezza nazionale cibernetica.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 25 outlines obligations related to incident notification that must be adhered to by public administrations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9f5969404a18bd68f16df966d64a713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b069a2848ec3f27bf4ee85e079a65b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56f6dc568e975b991ef77fef2b87308</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 23">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 23</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Articolo 23 is part of the regulatory framework detailing additional compliance obligations for essential and important entities.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 23 outlines additional obligations that are part of the regulatory framework applicable to essential and important subjects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9148f04f9e54ea8150d68b3f01084e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bca68d15e92b884efd92720e2c7854b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_42.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 24">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 24</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 24 outlines specific obligations related to risk management measures and incident notification within the NIS regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 24 describes further regulations that subjects must adhere to according to the national authority's requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 24 further delineates requirements and timelines for compliance under the NIS directive.&lt;SEP&gt;L'Articolo 24 stabilisce le regole e le responsabilità relative alla gestione dei rischi per la sicurezza informatica nei soggetti essenziali.</data>
