    <node id="Articolo 17">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 17</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 17 highlights the provisions related to the sharing of information regarding cybersecurity risks and incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 17 addresses information sharing agreements among various authorities regarding cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;L'Articolo 17 è una parte di un decreto che stabilisce disposizioni normative specifiche.&lt;SEP&gt;This article pertains to the cooperation and information exchange procedures adhered to by CSIRT Italia with relevant stakeholders.</data>
