    </node>
    <node id="Decreti del Presidente del Consiglio">
      <data key="d0">Decreti del Presidente del Consiglio</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decreti del Presidente del Consiglio are governmental decrees that are excluded from access and publication, related to the governance of crisis management procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Decreti del Presidente del Consiglio refers to decrees issued by the President of the Council of Ministers related to cybersecurity and regulation implementation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c34859ba6ebac9e5c64e24bf779250ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4342fc4ff6b1b13ab6a3f36cb4e0098a</data>
