      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Cybersecurity measures encompass actions and regulations implemented to protect national interests in cyberspace, including the adoption of decrees and determinations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a799f9bf34f632ba75a0112b5cf13046</data>
