    <node id="ENISA">
      <data key="d0">ENISA</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">ENISA is the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity, responsible for improving the overall cybersecurity in the EU according to regulation 2019/881.&lt;SEP&gt;ENISA, the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity, is an organization dedicated to enhancing the cybersecurity capabilities of EU member states. Its primary mission is to develop a high common level of cybersecurity within the European Union by providing non-binding guidelines, orientations, and expert consulting, particularly to the NIS authority. ENISA supports member states and EU institutions in addressing cybersecurity issues, offering a range of comprehensive measures that include the development of best practices and guidelines.

The agency plays a crucial role in organizing cybersecurity exercises and collaborating with EU member states to strengthen their security measures and infrastructure. Through various initiatives, ENISA focuses on improving the overall resilience of cyber systems throughout Europe, promoting robust cybersecurity practices, and publishing reports that contribute to the enhancement of cybersecurity efforts across the continent.

In summary, ENISA is essential for managing and advancing cybersecurity within the EU, ensuring a safer digital environment for all member states and reinforcing their capacity to handle cybersecurity challenges effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f8b069a2848ec3f27bf4ee85e079a65b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f4f98b1c2d2070c1c1800937a75e42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b824e0b89de2a1e27b0589d38a4cd97d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe9d12702503967b563f73226bd6c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c92e8c6868003608beac05c39d102b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220eea07a2d381346fd66282775c0dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b0bb9bde1347c627566bd2362d82fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d94ce1991a6e4ab6550c5f7d133849c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70958e41947f1856a02ce9f16c9fc2d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a09a98f23c165c2285989df098e2deae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0e4ec39b25d6db8b5b1e0c721b2754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15746586d8c2b78380d00c1c0f232f1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62eb392517072085e7cc966fc793312b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa41738f3458745ab6dcab4b840c0e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53b540306cae3f5d4ac372c47e02440&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec85a32073c7d50fe528ce38d609671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe</data>
