    <node id="Direttiva UE 2022/2555">
      <data key="d0">Direttiva UE 2022/2555</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Direttiva UE 2022/2555 is a legislative document that outlines requirements for network and information systems security across the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Direttiva UE 2022/2555 is a European directive on cybersecurity that the Italian legislative decree seeks to implement and comply with.</data>
