    <node id="Direttiva (UE) 2022/2555">
      <data key="d0">Direttiva (UE) 2022/2555</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">La direttiva (UE) 2022/2555 riguarda la sicurezza delle reti e dei sistemi informatici in tutta l'Unione Europea, stabilendo normative per garantire la cooperazione transfrontaliera.&lt;SEP&gt;La direttiva (UE) 2022/2555 stabilisce misure per garantire un elevato livello di cybersicurezza in tutto il territorio dell'Unione Europea.&lt;SEP&gt;The Direttiva (UE) 2022/2555 is a significant legislative act enacted by the European Union that establishes comprehensive regulations regarding cybersecurity and vulnerability management. This directive aims to enhance cybersecurity across member states by creating a unified framework for network and information system security. Specifically, it mandates that member states implement particular regulations governing their cybersecurity practices.

The directive not only specifies requirements for cybersecurity measures applicable to critical infrastructures but also emphasizes the importance of enhancing cooperation among EU member countries. Furthermore, it establishes obligations for notifying cybersecurity incidents and outlines protocols for coordinated responses to such incidents within the EU. Overall, the Direttiva (UE) 2022/2555 represents a pivotal effort to ensure a cohesive and robust approach to cybersecurity throughout the European Union, providing guidelines to facilitate the implementation of cybersecurity policies and vulnerability management across its member states.&lt;SEP&gt;La direttiva (UE) 2022/2555 stabilisce norme per garantire la sicurezza delle reti e dei sistemi informatici all'interno dell'Unione Europea.&lt;SEP&gt;The Directive (EU) 2022/2555 establishes a framework for enhancing cybersecurity across EU member states, impacting national strategies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a293b22d6e8bc5ec5a288e307c62dd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ddea58f25d264feccb012f5bdeeb220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c92e8c6868003608beac05c39d102b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a09a98f23c165c2285989df098e2deae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aeea7f868e572ca2683710a23021720&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-923745bc8c8ad932bf6f4d0e052b32a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b0bb9bde1347c627566bd2362d82fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9f5969404a18bd68f16df966d64a713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0e4ec39b25d6db8b5b1e0c721b2754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d776982364dc89bd130a2d3605148e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8b7f52f808d1b9c8258f9c2df76552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a27aa8d0bb3182a3820bfb4881cd0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d94ce1991a6e4ab6550c5f7d133849c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b39a557e445658829217fe6071239fa6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_19.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_20.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Punto di Contatto Unico NIS">
      <data key="d0">Punto di Contatto Unico NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Il Punto di Contatto Unico NIS è la struttura attraverso la quale avviene la notifica e consultazione tra le autorità competenti riguardo le attività ispettive e l'applicazione delle normative.&lt;SEP&gt;Punto di Contatto Unico NIS is a designated single point of contact for coordinating the implementation of the NIS Directive in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Punto di Contatto Unico NIS is the single contact point in Italy for NIS-related issues, facilitating communication between national authorities and the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Punto di Contatto Unico NIS serves as the single point of contact for national cybersecurity coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;The Single NIS Contact Point is also the National Cybersecurity Agency, facilitating communication regarding NIS matters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ea541069c915be71a2deaffcb4067d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfdc17b58a9995d6e89b17c17bad0e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-923745bc8c8ad932bf6f4d0e052b32a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-823e4bcb44a0430e6bbba96d50184704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bb9aa46445f5c1e7470669b4d00c3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Autorità nazionale di gestione delle crisi informatiche">
      <data key="d0">Autorità nazionale di gestione delle crisi informatiche</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">L'Autorità nazionale di gestione delle crisi informatiche coordina la risposta a incidenti di vasta scala e sviluppa piani nazionali di sicurezza.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità nazionale di gestione delle crisi informatiche handles national cybersecurity incident responses and crisis management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3ddea58f25d264feccb012f5bdeeb220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_19.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CSIRT nazionale">
      <data key="d0">CSIRT nazionale</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">CSIRT nazionale refers to the national Computer Security Incident Response Team tasked with responding to cybersecurity incidents and providing forensics data analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;CSIRT nazionale refers to the national Computer Security Incident Response Team, which in this context is CSIRT Italia, tasked with handling cybersecurity incidents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-20c6c883c71e0ab508dd69753b4dba4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672</data>
