    <node id="Regolamento (UE) 2019/881">
      <data key="d0">Regolamento (UE) 2019/881</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Il Regolamento (UE) 2019/881 stabilisce le normative sulla sicurezza informatica all'interno dell'Unione Europea.&lt;SEP&gt;Il Regolamento (UE) 2019/881 stabilisce le norme per la certificazione della cybersicurezza in Europa, promulgato il 17 aprile 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;Il Regolamento (UE) 2019/881 stabilisce norme sulla sicurezza delle reti e dei sistemi informativi nell'Unione Europea.&lt;SEP&gt;Il Regolamento (UE) 2019/881 stabilisce un quadro normativo per la sicurezza e l'integrità dei servizi e prodotti TIC.&lt;SEP&gt;Il Regolamento (UE) 2019/881 è una normativa europea che definisce le misure da adottare per garantire la sicurezza informatica.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ffa3df8decb742aba92a8f1157aabf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73766bc5881d3a614c830be383735389&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d86f884b11d63e7e3662ba605682245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b528329b76b06e8a0993b8b1545fb6f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336882dcda54fe306e031e3c16cc6ddb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Servizi fiduciari qualificati">
      <data key="d0">Servizi fiduciari qualificati</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">I servizi fiduciari qualificati sono servizi digitali riconosciuti per garantire la sicurezza e l'integrità delle trasazioni digitali.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b528329b76b06e8a0993b8b1545fb6f8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Schemi di certificazione della cybersicurezza">
      <data key="d0">Schemi di certificazione della cybersicurezza</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Schemi di certificazione della cybersicurezza sono sistemi riconosciuti che attestano la conformità delle tecnologie e dei servizi TIC ai requisiti di sicurezza.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b528329b76b06e8a0993b8b1545fb6f8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articolo 40, comma 5">
      <data key="d0">Articolo 40, comma 5</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 40, paragraph 5 provides procedural guidelines for how the Agency for National Cybersecurity establishes criteria for penalties.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 40, comma 5 indicates a specific section within legislation that provides the framework for the actions and responsibilities of the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS.&lt;SEP&gt;Articolo 40, comma 5 refers to a legal provision that allows specific entities to mandate the use of certified TIC products, services, and processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-af5e6f420f6cc4d279f4af29bbcf840e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594f5a01726ea26a8c05db0a073a3762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62ae4e3fef9aedd70aed7cff7804a838</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_32.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_27.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Schemi di Certificazione">
      <data key="d0">Schemi di Certificazione</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Schemi di Certificazione are certification schemes recognized at national or European levels that validate TIC products and services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-594f5a01726ea26a8c05db0a073a3762</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Categorie di Prodotti TIC">
      <data key="d0">Categorie di Prodotti TIC</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Categorie di Prodotti TIC are categories of TIC products that are subject to specific certification and compliance requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-594f5a01726ea26a8c05db0a073a3762</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_27.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Soggetti Essenziali e Importanti">
      <data key="d0">Soggetti Essenziali e Importanti</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Soggetti Essenziali e Importanti are classifications of subjects that must adhere to the regulations laid out in Article 40.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti Essenziali e Importanti are entities that provide crucial services or functions within the public administration sector and may be subject to regulatory obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-594f5a01726ea26a8c05db0a073a3762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62ae4e3fef9aedd70aed7cff7804a838</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_27.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_32.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Stati Membri">
      <data key="d0">Stati Membri</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Gli Stati Membri sono gli stati che partecipano alle iniziative del Gruppo di cooperazione NIS e collaborano su questioni di sicurezza informatica.&lt;SEP&gt;Gli Stati Membri sono le nazioni che partecipano alla cooperazione internazionale sotto la giurisdizione della NIS per fornire e ricevere servizi in ambito di sicurezza.&lt;SEP&gt;Stati Membri refers to the member states participating in the peer review process and contributing to the assessments in cybersecurity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-90d776982364dc89bd130a2d3605148e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8fb1e80c6588d63904d0fbfbe52f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea541069c915be71a2deaffcb4067d6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Attività Ispettive">
      <data key="d0">Attività Ispettive</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Le Attività Ispettive sono azioni condotte per verificare la conformità alle normative di sicurezza informatica e sono parte integrante della cooperazione NIS.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ea541069c915be71a2deaffcb4067d6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Misure di Esecuzione">
      <data key="d0">Misure di Esecuzione</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Le Misure di Esecuzione si riferiscono alle azioni adottate per implementare le decisioni normativi in materia di sicurezza informatica.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ea541069c915be71a2deaffcb4067d6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Autorità Competenti">
      <data key="d0">Autorità Competenti</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Le Autorità Competenti sono gli enti responsabili di garantire l'applicazione delle normative sulla sicurezza informatica nei rispettivi Stati Membri.&lt;SEP&gt;Le autorità competenti sono gli organismi governativi responsabili per la supervisione e l'attuazione della strategia nazionale per la cybersicurezza.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ea541069c915be71a2deaffcb4067d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70f0567946102de362e38795f66fb304</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_39.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Stati membri">
      <data key="d0">Stati membri</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Stati membri refers to EU member states participating in the cybersecurity framework and reviews conducted by ENISA.&lt;SEP&gt;Stati membri refers to the member states involved in these inspection activities and mutual assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Stati membri refers to the member states of the European Union that are involved in regulatory consultations with the NIS authority.&lt;SEP&gt;Stati membri refers to the member states of the European Union involved in the CSIRT network for cybersecurity collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;Stati membri refers to the member states within the European Union that provide services subjected to the decree mentioned.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-04c4f103bc5263a7ed18ca930ed8b9da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe9d12702503967b563f73226bd6c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b069a2848ec3f27bf4ee85e079a65b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b063d4fa6a2db553615300cf62e775bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53b540306cae3f5d4ac372c47e02440</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_20.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Direttiva 2022/2555">
      <data key="d0">Direttiva 2022/2555</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Direttiva 2022/2555 is a regulatory directive related to cybersecurity, under which authorities can exercise their powers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Direttiva 2022/2555 is a legislative directive that outlines regulations regarding mutual assistance and inspection powers among member states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fe9d12702503967b563f73226bd6c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53b540306cae3f5d4ac372c47e02440</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="attività ispettive">
      <data key="d0">attività ispettive</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Attività ispettive are joint inspection activities that can be carried out by the NIS and other competent authorities to ensure regulatory compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fe9d12702503967b563f73226bd6c4b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="assistenza reciproca">
      <data key="d0">assistenza reciproca</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Assistenza reciproca involves mutual assistance provided by CSIRT Italia to other national CSIRTs during cybersecurity incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Assistenza reciproca refers to mutual assistance provided by authorities of different member states in regulatory enforcement and compliance activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-20c6c883c71e0ab508dd69753b4dba4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe9d12702503967b563f73226bd6c4b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_15.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_39.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Settori e Sottosettori">
      <data key="d0">Settori e Sottosettori</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Settori e Sottosettori sono classificazioni di soggetti tenuti ad applicare requisiti di sicurezza informatica in base al grado di esposizione e all'importanza.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Articoli 23, 24, 25, 27, 28 e 29">
      <data key="d0">Articoli 23, 24, 25, 27, 28 e 29</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Articles 23, 24, 25, 27, 28, and 29 outline the legal framework and obligations that the national competent authority must adhere to regarding cybersecurity measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Articoli 23, 24, 25, 27, 28 e 29 refers to specific articles within a legal context that outline obligations and regulations related to significant incidents in the public administration supply chain.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62ae4e3fef9aedd70aed7cff7804a838</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_31.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_32.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Obblighi Proporzionati">
      <data key="d0">Obblighi Proporzionati</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Proportional obligations refer to the requirements set forth by the NIS authority, which are tailored according to the exposure levels and sizes of different entities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Settore">
      <data key="d0">Settore</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The sector refers to specific areas of economic activity that the NIS authority considers when regulating cybersecurity obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Sottosettore">
      <data key="d0">Sottosettore</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Subsector is a subdivision of a sector that further classifies entities to apply specific cybersecurity requirements according to their characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Fattispecie">
      <data key="d0">Fattispecie</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fattispecie refers to specific cases that lead to the suspension of deadlines established by cybersecurity obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Linee Guida Vincolanti">
      <data key="d0">Linee Guida Vincolanti</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Binding guidelines are mandatory instructions issued by the NIS authority to ensure proper implementation of cybersecurity obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;Linee Guida Vincolanti are mandatory guidelines that the Autorità nazionale competente NIS can issue to ensure compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f628afacbf45a56e2ceb0c53612e2da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Raccomandazioni">
      <data key="d0">Raccomandazioni</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Raccomandazioni are recommendations that the Autorità nazionale competente NIS can provide to assist entities in implementing compliance obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;Recommendations are supportive measures issued by the NIS authority to assist entities in adhering to cybersecurity requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Raccomandazioni are the recommendations provided by the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS following audits or inspections to help organizations improve their security practices.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f628afacbf45a56e2ceb0c53612e2da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c53c7a599fb091954200aad1210eb82</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_31.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Directive (UE) 2022/2555">
      <data key="d0">Directive (UE) 2022/2555</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Directive (UE) 2022/2555 outlines regulations concerning cybersecurity and related guidelines in the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regolamento (UE) 1025/2012">
      <data key="d0">Regolamento (UE) 1025/2012</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Il Regolamento (UE) 1025/2012 riguarda le norme sulle specifiche tecniche adottate da organismi di normazione e contribuisce allo sviluppo della sicurezza informatica.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regolamento (UE) 1025/2012 establishes rules for the European standardization process to be applied in various sectors for harmonizing systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-90d776982364dc89bd130a2d3605148e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Misure di gestione dei rischi per la sicurezza informatica">
      <data key="d0">Misure di gestione dei rischi per la sicurezza informatica</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Misure di gestione dei rischi per la sicurezza informatica represents the risk management measures designed to secure information systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Sistemi informativi e di rete">
      <data key="d0">Sistemi informativi e di rete</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">I sistemi informativi e di rete sono infrastrutture critiche per la gestione dei dati e delle comunicazioni, soggette a regolamentazioni specifiche in materia di cybersicurezza.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistemi informativi e di rete refers to the informational and networking systems that are targeted for security enhancements as guided by national and EU regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3e7fac5748da064969247b7c14dfa1bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0e3349b8cc8de1fb400ca0da504fff</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_33.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Sito">
      <data key="d0">Sito</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sito refers to a website or online platform where regulatory and technical standards are published for public access.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1438f57bb8c01c2bc53a9597dce8694f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Norme di Settore">
      <data key="d0">Norme di Settore</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Norme di Settore refers to the sector-specific standards that apply to various entities engaged in cybersecurity within both a national and European framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1438f57bb8c01c2bc53a9597dce8694f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Allegati">
      <data key="d0">Allegati</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Allegati refers to the attachments that include details on various subjects outlined in the decree, which are comprehensive in nature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1438f57bb8c01c2bc53a9597dce8694f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_28.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="decreto legislativo NIS">
      <data key="d0">decreto legislativo NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decreto legislativo NIS refers to the legislative act that implements the EU NIS Directive in Italy, which aims to achieve a high common level of cybersecurity in the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_43.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="direttiva (UE) 2022/2555">
      <data key="d0">direttiva (UE) 2022/2555</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Direttiva (UE) 2022/2555 is a European Union directive adopted on December 14, 2022, aimed at improving the overall cybersecurity framework across member states. This directive focuses on establishing robust cybersecurity measures and outlines the role of Computer Security Incident Response Teams (CSIRTs) within the EU. It provides guidelines and frameworks for managing cybersecurity, including incident response and cooperation among member states. The directive was established by the European Parliament and the Council to enhance cybersecurity efforts, ensuring effective reporting procedures and coordination in addressing cybersecurity challenges at the EU level.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-04c4f103bc5263a7ed18ca930ed8b9da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8377fe9a87e8f911c762411e7d09fbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b824e0b89de2a1e27b0589d38a4cd97d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b762ae6bc9abced0fc47e1227f90166b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_20.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="regolamento (UE) n. 910/2014">
      <data key="d0">regolamento (UE) n. 910/2014</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Il regolamento (UE) n. 910/2014 concerne l'identificazione elettronica e i servizi fiduciari per le transazioni elettroniche nel mercato interno.&lt;SEP&gt;Regolamento (UE) n. 910/2014 establishes electronic identification and trust services for electronic transactions in the European single market.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb90921644ffffadb05538947b578b77</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_43.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="direttiva (UE) 2018/1972">
      <data key="d0">direttiva (UE) 2018/1972</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Direttiva (UE) 2018/1972 aims to establish the European Electronic Communications Code, setting standards for telecommunications in the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_43.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="direttiva (UE) 2016/1148">
      <data key="d0">direttiva (UE) 2016/1148</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Direttiva (UE) 2016/1148, also known as the NIS Directive, focuses on the cybersecurity of network and information systems across the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_43.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Decreto Legislativo NIS">
      <data key="d0">Decreto Legislativo NIS</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Il decreto legislativo NIS stabilisce le norme per garantire la sicurezza delle reti e dei sistemi informatici, e definisce i ruoli e le responsabilità delle autorità nazionali.&lt;SEP&gt;The Decreto Legislativo NIS refers to legislative measures concerning national cybersecurity in Italy, which includes provisions for essential and important subjects related to cybersecurity obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f2ee79d69b2e0e0b40a96b7e26f33e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0038be33f7feedcdeb87d1ba67ddaabe</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_43.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Decreto Legge 21 Settembre 2019, n. 105">
      <data key="d0">Decreto Legge 21 Settembre 2019, n. 105</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Il decreto legge stabilisce le modifiche normative necessarie per la sicurezza delle reti e dei sistemi informatici.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f2ee79d69b2e0e0b40a96b7e26f33e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_43.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Legge del 18 Novembre 2019, n. 133">
      <data key="d0">Legge del 18 Novembre 2019, n. 133</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">La legge del 18 novembre 2019 apporta modifiche al decreto legge 21 settembre 2019, n. 105, coordinando regole per la sicurezza informatica.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f2ee79d69b2e0e0b40a96b7e26f33e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_articles/article_43.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Soggetti Inclusi nel Perimetro di Sicurezza Nazionale Cibernetica">
      <data key="d0">Soggetti Inclusi nel Perimetro di Sicurezza Nazionale Cibernetica</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">I soggetti inclusi nel perimetro di sicurezza nazionale cibernetica sono enti o organizzazioni che devono seguire normative specifiche per garantire la sicurezza delle infrastrutture.&lt;SEP&gt;This category includes entities recognized within the national cybersecurity perimeter that are governed by the directives of the NIS legislation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f2ee79d69b2e0e0b40a96b7e26f33e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0038be33f7feedcdeb87d1ba67ddaabe</data>
