      <data key="d0">Soggetti Critici</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dfdc17b58a9995d6e89b17c17bad0e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca2f8d685c1e46812789bb56f1f5f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd23bee19c00c0afe07a6df8f6d9bb94</data>
      <data key="d2">I soggetti essenziali possono essere considerati critici a causa del loro impatto sulla società e sull'economia.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti Critici pertains to the essential or important entities designated by regulations whose operations significantly impact cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggetti Critici are those identified as critical under the EU directive 2022/2557, highlighted in the legislative decree.</data>
