      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Garante per la protezione dei dati personali is the Italian Data Protection Authority that oversees data protection regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Garante per la protezione dei dati personali is the data protection authority in Italy, overseeing compliance with data protection regulations.</data>
