      <data key="d0">Autorità nazionale competente</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The National Competent Authority is responsible for overseeing the implementation of the NIS directive and is involved in identifying and addressing cybersecurity risks related to critical infrastructure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-113a7f129467195a5802770e0a180e02</data>
