      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Information refers to data or insights exchanged between authorities and critical entities to enhance cybersecurity measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Informazioni refers to the information that may be requested by L'Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS during their verification processes.</data>
