      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Gruppi nazionali di risposta agli incidenti di sicurezza informatica are national response teams that collaborate on cybersecurity incidents and threats.&lt;SEP&gt;These are national groups tasked with responding to cybersecurity incidents, with which CSIRT Italia establishes cooperation.&lt;SEP&gt;These are national groups responsible for responding to cybersecurity incidents under the NIS directive framework, dedicated to securing digital infrastructures.</data>
