      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Italia is a country in Southern Europe involved in national procedures to manage large-scale cybersecurity incidents and crises at the European Union level.&lt;SEP&gt;Italia is the country responsible for implementing the National Plan and ensuring coordinated management of cyber incidents at the EU level.</data>
