      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">National Authorities for Cyber Crisis Management handle large-scale cybersecurity incidents and crises, consisting of the National Cybersecurity Agency and the Ministry of Defense.&lt;SEP&gt;National Authorities for the Management of Cyber Crises are responsible for executing the measures defined in the National Plan to handle cybersecurity incidents.</data>
