    <edge source="Soggetti Essenziali" target="Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS">
      <data key="d5">70.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS can impose sanctions on Soggetti Essenziali for non-compliance with regulatory obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS is an authoritative body tasked with the protection and regulation of Soggetti Essenziali (Essential Subjects) against cyber threats. This involves monitoring the compliance and security measures of these entities to ensure they adhere to national laws. The Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS interacts closely with Soggetti Essenziali, facilitating their compliance with mandatory communication standards. Furthermore, this authority is responsible for compiling a list of Soggetti Essenziali based on their registrations and identifying them in accordance with specific regulations established in a decree. Overall, the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS plays a crucial role in safeguarding essential entities through oversight and regulatory compliance.</data>
      <data key="d7">monitoraggio, compliance&lt;SEP&gt;oversight responsibility, regulatory authority&lt;SEP&gt;protezione, sicurezza&lt;SEP&gt;regolamentazione, identificazione&lt;SEP&gt;regulation, compliance&lt;SEP&gt;regulatory authority, compliance monitoring&lt;SEP&gt;regulatory interaction, compliance&lt;SEP&gt;regulatory oversight, compliance enforcement</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-6bca68d15e92b884efd92720e2c7854b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd23bee19c00c0afe07a6df8f6d9bb94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc2d05ad9613f280438ab5c7cc47980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6125ee49e9153fb4b54bb70ae56be103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70958e41947f1856a02ce9f16c9fc2d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d776982364dc89bd130a2d3605148e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86656548de9bfd0478a2d1b0fe96d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_6.json</data>
    </edge>
