    <edge source="Soggetti Importanti" target="Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS">
      <data key="d5">50.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS plays a crucial role in regulating the security obligations of Soggetti Importanti within the sector. It oversees their compliance with the legislative framework, ensuring that they adhere to the guidelines provided for their categorization. The authority tracks Soggetti Importanti through a registration system, which aids in monitoring their activities. Additionally, the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS is responsible for defining Soggetti Importanti that do not fall under the category of Soggetti Essenziali. The authority also has the power to impose penalties for any violations of regulations, reinforcing the importance of compliance within the sector.</data>
