    <edge source="Gruppo di cooperazione NIS" target="EU-CyCLONe">
      <data key="d5">34.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Both the Gruppo di cooperazione NIS and EU-CyCLONe focus on improving cybersecurity cooperation as mandated by the EU directive 2022/2555.&lt;SEP&gt;EU-CyCLONe collaborates with the Gruppo di cooperazione NIS to coordinate information sharing regarding cybersecurity incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;EU-CyCLONe serves as a network to further the objectives of the Gruppo di cooperazione NIS in crisis management for cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;EU-CyCLONe was formed as part of the Gruppo di cooperazione NIS for crisis management and incidents response.</data>
