    <edge source="Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale" target="Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS">
      <data key="d5">51.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale and the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS work in tandem to enhance cybersecurity within their jurisdiction. The Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS possesses execution and supervision powers, which the Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale references to ensure overall security. Furthermore, the Autorità adopts coordinated disclosure policies that the Agenzia implements technically, demonstrating a collaborative approach.

In their partnership, the Autorità National Competente NIS and the Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale focus on the protection of critical infrastructures and the management of cyber threats. To bolster these efforts, the Agenzia suggests cybersecurity experts to the Autorità for conducting essential reviews, thus leveraging specialized knowledge for improved enforcement and compliance.

Additionally, the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS is characterized as the National Cybersecurity Agency with a mandate for ensuring compliance with NIS regulations. In this capacity, it relies significantly on the guidance provided by the Agenzia per la Cybersicurezza Nazionale regarding sanctions related to cybersecurity matters. Overall, both entities play crucial roles in fortifying Italy's cybersecurity landscape by coordinating their efforts and expertise.</data>
      <data key="d7">authority designation, regulatory compliance&lt;SEP&gt;collaborazione, gestione delle minacce&lt;SEP&gt;cooperazione, sicurezza informatica&lt;SEP&gt;cybersecurity oversight, regulatory relationship&lt;SEP&gt;policy implementation, cybersecurity&lt;SEP&gt;regulatory supervision, partnership</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-923745bc8c8ad932bf6f4d0e052b32a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd252fa1c05426d3e43270f7b9103fd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5e6f420f6cc4d279f4af29bbcf840e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0e4ec39b25d6db8b5b1e0c721b2754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841174697e4d1adb00807b4c235dad95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe59d78b7f30a5635c0de425f655d571</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_16.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_38.json</data>
    </edge>
