    <edge source="Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale" target="decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82">
      <data key="d5">26.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Agenzia operates under the regulations specified in the decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82, which outlines its responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale implements the policies set forth in decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82 regarding national cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale is responsible for ensuring compliance with the measures outlined in the decreto-legge 14 giugno 2021, n. 82, contributing to national cybersecurity efforts.</data>
      <data key="d7">legislation compliance, cybersecurity coordination&lt;SEP&gt;legislation, agency function&lt;SEP&gt;policy implementation, cybersecurity</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ee6efc1b71296d03487494b724c62db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4afbcc356a5cad070006284b04c6eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_4.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale" target="Presidente del Consiglio dei ministri">
      <data key="d5">43.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Agenzia for cybersecurity reports to the Presidente del Consiglio dei ministri regarding the evaluation and adoption of cybersecurity strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale operates under the authority of the Presidente del Consiglio dei ministri, implementing directives related to national cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;The President of the Council of Ministers oversees the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale's operations regarding national cybersecurity initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;The Presidente del Consiglio dei ministri issues decrees based on proposals from the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale for national cybersecurity efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Presidente del Consiglio dei ministri approves proposals made by the Agenzia regarding the national cybersecurity strategy.</data>
      <data key="d7">government action, cybersecurity&lt;SEP&gt;government oversight, cybersecurity management&lt;SEP&gt;government oversight, cybersecurity policy&lt;SEP&gt;government regulation, organizational hierarchy&lt;SEP&gt;leadership oversight, national security</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-d008e433ea6328598c9f502f5b2a9875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a799f9bf34f632ba75a0112b5cf13046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ac85b75b9a0982916688ed2e7a5268&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4afbcc356a5cad070006284b04c6eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_4.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_9.json</data>
    </edge>
