      <data key="d5">8.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Ministry of Justice collaborates with the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale to ensure legal compliance in cybersecurity matters.</data>
      <data key="d7">government collaboration, legal compliance</data>
