    </edge>
    <edge source="Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale" target="Ministero della difesa">
      <data key="d5">56.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale and the Ministero della difesa are both designated as national authorities responsible for managing cybersecurity crises in Italy, each within their respective areas of competence. The Ministero della difesa collaborates with the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale in relation to the decree regarding cybersecurity, specifically in the context of crisis management and response. This collaboration ensures a coordinated approach to addressing national security matters related to cybersecurity, with both organizations working alongside each other to effectively manage and respond to cybersecurity crises at the national level.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale and the Ministero della difesa collaborate in managing large-scale cybersecurity incidents and crises.</data>
      <data key="d7">collaboration, crisis management&lt;SEP&gt;collaborazione, cybersecurity&lt;SEP&gt;government collaboration, crisis management&lt;SEP&gt;government collaboration, crisis response&lt;SEP&gt;government cooperation, crisis management&lt;SEP&gt;national defense, cybersecurity coordination&lt;SEP&gt;national security, crisis management</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-652723170e3dd859cd0068aaf16e5458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b762ae6bc9abced0fc47e1227f90166b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f036d26b472f0c8e276a34cd467ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3574f28f12a3390bb92440df5eda9ca</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_4.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_13.json</data>
    </edge>
