    <edge source="Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale" target="CSIRT Italia">
      <data key="d5">76.0</data>
      <data key="d6">CSIRT Italia collaborates closely with the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale (National Cybersecurity Agency) to manage significant cybersecurity incidents and inform the public. This partnership involves ongoing support from CSIRT Italia in accordance with national directives, particularly during cybersecurity crises. Additionally, the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale designates CSIRT Italia as the national Computer Security Incident Response Team (CSIRT), underscoring their responsibility for cybersecurity coordination. Together, they coordinate efforts for information sharing regarding cybersecurity incidents and implement technical means for coordinating vulnerability disclosures, ensuring a comprehensive response to national cybersecurity challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale works alongside CSIRT Italia to manage cybersecurity incident responses in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;CSIRT Italia operates under the auspices of the National Cybersecurity Agency to respond to security incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;CSIRT Italia operates within the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale, functioning under its framework for cybersecurity incident management.</data>
      <data key="d7">agency designation, cybersecurity coordination&lt;SEP&gt;collaboration, cybersecurity&lt;SEP&gt;collaboration, cybersecurity response&lt;SEP&gt;incident response, collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;incident response, security support&lt;SEP&gt;information sharing, cybersecurity coordination&lt;SEP&gt;national response team, agency collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;organizational structure, cybersecurity&lt;SEP&gt;technical cooperation, cybersecurity</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-c7e4324dfac9792a4d9eef15127f75b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3116d335c306732798ce61c729fe9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b824e0b89de2a1e27b0589d38a4cd97d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec85a32073c7d50fe528ce38d609671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff335b46be4d8c897c91e91c5b4e16d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61a00d31e1311eeb0bfc4d1c07f4a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f22c934531d8f178ee55850be26e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d17c52d9eed39854a6245d94eb672</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_16.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_25.json</data>
    </edge>
