      <data key="d5">27.0</data>
      <data key="d6">National authorities work alongside the National Cybersecurity Agency to handle large-scale cybersecurity crises and ensure effective responses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale works as part of the national authorities to manage cybersecurity by coordinating resources and capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità nazionali di gestione delle crisi informatiche collaborates with the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale to manage large-scale cybersecurity crises.</data>
