    <edge source="Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale" target="Tavolo per l'attuazione della disciplina NIS">
      <data key="d5">44.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Agenzia for cybersecurity collaborates with the Tavolo for implementing NIS regulations, ensuring coordinated efforts in cybersecurity management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale collaborates with the Tavolo per l'attuazione della disciplina NIS to establish cybersecurity protocols and guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tavolo collaborates with the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale to ensure effective implementation of NIS directives.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tavolo is constituted within the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale to implement the NIS Directive.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tavolo was established under the auspices of the Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale to implement cybersecurity measures.</data>
      <data key="d7">collaboration, cybersecurity implementation&lt;SEP&gt;collaboration, regulatory compliance&lt;SEP&gt;cybersecurity collaboration, policy implementation&lt;SEP&gt;organizational oversight, cybersecurity&lt;SEP&gt;organizational structure, government initiative</data>
