    <edge source="Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale" target="direttiva (UE) 2022/2555">
      <data key="d5">27.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Agenzia per la cybersicurezza nazionale operates under the framework established by the direttiva (UE) 2022/2555 to enhance national cybersecurity measures.&lt;SEP&gt;The agency operates under guidelines established by the directive (EU) 2022/2555 for managing cybersecurity risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The directive outlines the establishment and operation of the National Cybersecurity Agency, defining its responsibilities in cybersecurity incidents.</data>
