    <edge source="Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS" target="Piattaforma Digitale">
      <data key="d5">49.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS (National Competent Authority for NIS) primarily interacts with various entities through the Piattaforma Digitale (Digital Platform). This platform is essential for facilitating communications concerning audits and security, enabling the authority to collect and verify important communications from essential and significant subjects regarding their cybersecurity obligations. Additionally, the Piattaforma Digitale plays a crucial role in managing the registration of these entities for cybersecurity purposes. It serves as the primary means by which entities communicate information to the Autorità Nazionale Competente NIS.</data>
      <data key="d7">communication channel, digital interaction&lt;SEP&gt;communication channel, information sharing&lt;SEP&gt;communication tool, interaction method&lt;SEP&gt;compliance, digital platform&lt;SEP&gt;digital communication, cybersecurity interaction&lt;SEP&gt;gestione registrazioni, cybersicurezza</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-2ce5584bb9ddb5d15f3b04a7cd5d1c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d789cac2fbcd408ecf4c33f215039d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3450ba5bfe3386a0c6435df02b3bcbf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753a7ed896a229ef5f44ed6c498cbd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86656548de9bfd0478a2d1b0fe96d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34335c29594d48a2a4f48f1075d31fcb</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_31.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_articles/article_34.json</data>
    </edge>
