    </edge>
    <edge source="Autorità nazionale competente NIS" target="Stati membri">
      <data key="d5">25.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The Autorità nazionale competente NIS collaborates with Stati membri to provide assistance and oversee compliance with inspection mandates.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità nazionale competente NIS collaborates with other Stati membri on regulatory actions and inspections.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autorità nazionale competente NIS oversees and coordinates the reporting of services offered by the Stati membri within the EU context.</data>
      <data key="d7">cooperation, compliance&lt;SEP&gt;international cooperation, regulatory actions&lt;SEP&gt;regulatory compliance, service oversight</data>
