    </edge>
    <edge source="soggetto essenziale" target="soggetto importante">
      <data key="d5">8.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Soggetti essenziali and soggetti importanti are categories of entities that are both defined by their critical roles in compliance and administration, often facing similar regulatory measures.</data>
      <data key="d7">regulatory roles, administrative significance</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-3fc6cb82fc59fd64c26c25aeeb268218</data>
      <data key="d9">./cached_articles/article_38.json</data>
    </edge>
